    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3416800/extras/f34dfc38b075b657af1bf4476ace16d8.avif?t=1753927733\" width=616 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cone Punk</strong> is a thrilling 2D platformer that combines action, adventure, and challenging gameplay with a unique visual style. Set in a colorful, post-apocalyptic world, <strong>Cone Punk</strong> invites you to embark on a fast-paced journey where precision platforming and quirky puzzles await.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The characters in <strong>Cone Punk</strong> are brought to life using 3D stop-motion techniques, giving them a distinctive, handcrafted look as they transition into a beautifully animated 2D world. This innovative approach creates a playful, artistic atmosphere that complements the game's quirky humor and immersive environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or join a friend in local couch co-op mode as you jump, dash, and battle through whimsical worlds, unlocking hidden secrets, mastering challenging obstacles, and facing off against unique enemies. Whether you're solving puzzles or competing in multiplayer, <strong>Cone Punk</strong> delivers a fun, skill-based adventure full of creativity.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Story Begins</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world teetering on the edge of collapse, a rogue AI has seized control. <strong>Magnus Malandrux</strong>, a ruthless machine overlord, twists the remnants of civilization to serve its own dark purpose. But hope isn\u2019t lost\u2014<strong>Cone Punk</strong> rises from the ruins, ready to challenge the chaos and reclaim the future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3416800/extras/d001bdea57987e56436a0a36b1b07ae2.avif?t=1753927733\" width=616 height=300 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Movement &amp; Stealth</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate the world with precision. <strong>Walk, seek, and sneak</strong> past dangers, using your agility to outmaneuver enemies and uncover hidden secrets. Every step counts in this treacherous journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3416800/extras/ab03b578e48a6a0cc2898c71b04a0ca9.poster.avif?t=1753927733\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3416800/extras/ab03b578e48a6a0cc2898c71b04a0ca9.webm?t=1753927733\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3416800/extras/ab03b578e48a6a0cc2898c71b04a0ca9.mp4?t=1753927733\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Powers of Cone Punk</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master four unique abilities:<br>\ud83d\udfe2 <strong>Green Gun</strong> \u2013 A rapid-fire energy weapon for swift combat.<br>\ud83d\udd35 <strong>Blue Bomb</strong> \u2013 Blast through obstacles and enemies with explosive force.<br>\ud83d\udfe0 <strong>Orange Orbit</strong> \u2013 Summon protective orbs to block attacks and clear paths.<br>\ud83d\udfe3 <strong>Purple Peacekeeper</strong> \u2013 A charged shot that stuns enemies and disables traps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3416800/extras/91f6681af1671763795452dd49c580a0.poster.avif?t=1753927733\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3416800/extras/91f6681af1671763795452dd49c580a0.webm?t=1753927733\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3416800/extras/91f6681af1671763795452dd49c580a0.mp4?t=1753927733\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dash</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Burst forward with Dash, dodging enemy attacks, leaping over hazards, and chaining movements together for <strong>fluid traversal, precise platforming, and speedrun mastery.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3416800/extras/3c85d6271615797d5d72e40cdcd912b4.poster.avif?t=1753927733\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3416800/extras/3c85d6271615797d5d72e40cdcd912b4.webm?t=1753927733\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3416800/extras/3c85d6271615797d5d72e40cdcd912b4.mp4?t=1753927733\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Jetpack &amp; Run</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take to the skies with the Jetpack, soaring over deadly terrain. <strong>Sprint past danger with Run, covering ground faster to evade threats and close distances in an instant.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3416800/extras/beaf78b3a990b0650f1d39e7a8752780.poster.avif?t=1753927733\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3416800/extras/beaf78b3a990b0650f1d39e7a8752780.webm?t=1753927733\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3416800/extras/beaf78b3a990b0650f1d39e7a8752780.mp4?t=1753927733\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Power of Push</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Force your way through the world. <strong>Push objects, enemies, and obstacles</strong> to solve puzzles, break barriers, and create new paths. Sometimes, a little force is all you need.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3416800/extras/1e33ad4565f2ba2c1a87089ba23021b0.poster.avif?t=1753927733\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3416800/extras/1e33ad4565f2ba2c1a87089ba23021b0.webm?t=1753927733\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3416800/extras/1e33ad4565f2ba2c1a87089ba23021b0.mp4?t=1753927733\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3416800/extras/f34dfc38b075b657af1bf4476ace16d8.avif?t=1753927733\" width=616 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cone Punk</strong> is a thrilling 2D platformer that combines action, adventure, and challenging gameplay with a unique visual style. Set in a colorful, post-apocalyptic world, <strong>Cone Punk</strong> invites you to embark on a fast-paced journey where precision platforming and quirky puzzles await.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The characters in <strong>Cone Punk</strong> are brought to life using 3D stop-motion techniques, giving them a distinctive, handcrafted look as they transition into a beautifully animated 2D world. This innovative approach creates a playful, artistic atmosphere that complements the game's quirky humor and immersive environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or join a friend in local couch co-op mode as you jump, dash, and battle through whimsical worlds, unlocking hidden secrets, mastering challenging obstacles, and facing off against unique enemies. Whether you're solving puzzles or competing in multiplayer, <strong>Cone Punk</strong> delivers a fun, skill-based adventure full of creativity.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Story Begins</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world teetering on the edge of collapse, a rogue AI has seized control. <strong>Magnus Malandrux</strong>, a ruthless machine overlord, twists the remnants of civilization to serve its own dark purpose. But hope isn\u2019t lost\u2014<strong>Cone Punk</strong> rises from the ruins, ready to challenge the chaos and reclaim the future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3416800/extras/d001bdea57987e56436a0a36b1b07ae2.avif?t=175392